title: Shared through a relay: the guest joins with a cc2 invitation, both type in one file and the guest's save reaches the host's disk
folders: rust-small
limit: 100
relay: on
expect-log: share: sharing through the relay at 127\.0\.0\.1:
expect-log: share: the relay at 127\.0\.0\.1:\d+ gave the room \w+
expect-log: share: the invitation is ready, through the relay
expect-log: is shared, \d+ files
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared
relay-expect-log: room \w+ opened
relay-expect-log: a guest joined room \w+
expect-file: rust-small/src/main.rs :: from Beto through the relay
expect-file: rust-small/src/main.rs :: from the host

wait 3000
left settings:relay
wait 1200
mark settings-sharing
wait 800
left settings:close
wait 400
goto src/main.rs
share relay {RELAY}
share panel
wait 1200
mark host-before-sharing
wait 800
share panel close
wait 300
share start writers
wait 2500
share panel
wait 1200
mark host-relay-panel
wait 800
share panel close
wait 8000
edit src/main.rs 4 1
key end
type  // from the host
wait 4000
mark host-both
wait 7000
share stop
wait 1200
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1500
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
goto src/main.rs
wait 1200
tool edit
edit src/main.rs 6 1
type // from Beto through the relay
wait 5500
mark both
wait 1500
key save
wait 6000
quit
wait 1500
